cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Blender Optics Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A Blender add-on to design, simulate, align, and render optical setups: a live single-ray
  geometric beam tracer with analytic physics overlays (Jones/Stokes polarization, Gaussian-beam
  ABCD propagation, interference fringes), kinematic-mount auto-alignment, a modal adaptive-optics
  loop, a real-vendor component library, and a headless optics_api plus a localhost MCP bridge an
  AI agent can drive.
type: software
